{"id": "7th-t3-u3-q364", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u3-maanudam", "lesson_id": "lesson-15-thirukkural-part2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-u3-action-factors-count-direct", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஒரு செயலைச் செய்வதற்கு முன்பாக ஆராய வேண்டிய இன்றியமையாத கூறுகள் எத்தனை என வள்ளுவர் கூறுகிறார்?"}], "options": {"A": "இரண்டு", "B": "மூன்று", "C": "நான்கு", "D": "ஐந்து"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 67 குறள் 5: 'பொருள்கருவி காலம் வினையிடனொடு ஐந்தும் / இருள்தீர எண்ணிச் செயல்' - பொருள், கருவி, காலம், வினை, இடம் ஆகிய 'ஐந்து' கூறுகளை ஆராய வேண்டும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How many essential factors does Valluvar specify must be weighed without doubt before undertaking an action?"}], "options": {"A": "Two", "B": "Three", "C": "Four", "D": "Five"}, "explanation": "Page 67 Kural 5: Material, tool, time, deed, and place form the 'five' factors to be calculated."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 67, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_note